{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_07_end","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_07","title":"乱局","storyCode":"IW-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"b57fba0de4a9673289fc2613599f8a843add5881def14f5fa64e780490b1acf0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"独自在山间寻盏的老鲤却遇到了年，而后又遇到了追来的左乐。年将三人带往本应毁去的寻日峰上，见到了那处凉亭。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"07下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到哪儿去了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那边的树杈上......而且还聚起了这么一大批古灵精怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，这下我要怎么取来呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"一枚黑子。\n万物皆有所待，这些器伥的脾性，是和这些器物的“意”相通的。\n那么，扰我清静的......\n是我那摆弄画卷泼墨江山的妹妹呢，还是那一字千金口含天宪的妹妹呢？\n又或者......\n只是他一子拍下，砸起的片刻杂音呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜——呜呜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？您应该是......罗德岛的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊。原来是老鲤啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，怎么从龙门来尚蜀了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你说掌柜的抽刀而走，是不是找谁干架去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这些新来的，已经不见掌柜的用刀啦。想来也是，家大业大的，光靠酒楼就能在尚蜀站稳脚跟了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌柜的到底怎么用刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌柜的这些年，用刀的次数实在不多。真要说，那就是砍瓜切菜，剁肉杀鳞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起过去打打杀杀的日子，郑掌柜已经很久不以“伤人”为目的用刀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有一种江湖高人隐退的感觉？那现在他带刀出去做啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切菜吧。切了这么久的菜了，掌柜的也就会切切菜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无聊哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那咋的，切那么多年菜，还能变厉害不成？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好刀法！看来你这几年不光是在当一个掌柜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我确实没有再用过刀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"习惯了持筹握算，柴米油盐......我也没想到，这把霜刀如今还能如此顺手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意料之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还在想，要是遇到的是一个郁郁寡欢的郑清钺，打赢了又怎样，输了又怎样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来是天意如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——什么天意，不过是你一厢情愿想要报仇罢了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿！你别插手！快去追那个龙门人，找到酒盏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了爹，这件事你可做不了主——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就猜到会这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我从来没打过她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会后悔的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太合叔。你去帮掌柜的一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找盏，此事耽搁不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你这大块头能不能悠着点，再拆下去我们怎么下山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"困兽之斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人！这里我拖着，你先去帮鲤兄！别让那小子得手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！你自己注意！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我告诉你可别欺负人啊，就因为你是当官的我才不敢动手的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......官身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既为报知遇之恩，与左公子同行，还谈什么官身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来！廉家传人，你我单纯以武人身份，互相试试斤两。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就得罪了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下雨了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......下起雨来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明天气预报说今天都是晴天来着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶馆伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客人，下雨了，您要不挪步去里头坐坐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶馆伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客人是想赏雨景？好兴致好兴致，那我一会儿给您把伞撑起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶馆伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陪您一起的那位船夫呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他上山去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶馆伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这会上山？天黑了怕是下不来山哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我麻烦他了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！是那个龙门人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"器伥围在他身边......？等等，他旁边那个人是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。好像有新客人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是来抢这只酒盏的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。比起预想，已经算人少一些的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎司岁台秉烛人左乐，奉太傅手谕，密查夕与黑酒盏下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷......嗷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些小东西，似乎挺怕你俩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕我嘛，正常，怕这个小子嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上带着什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是机敏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼......是这样......就和那个糟老头子说的一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么鲤先生又是怎么和这件事扯上关系的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年小姐，这其中恐怕说来话长......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过把罗德岛几位干员卷入其中，我深感愧疚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨。克洛丝和小炎熔要是经历不起这点风浪，她们也很难见证到最后了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎呀，年小姐真是没变呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这两天，我们可被折腾惨了。不过那个可怕的老头儿还是告诉了我们一些事情的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括司岁台和礼部之间的小摩擦。这位小哥，你们就这么急着......想除掉我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了我擅自把夕带离她的舒适小窝，一定有别的什么原因吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来听听？要是说得有理，指不定我能改变心思，帮你们一把哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过既然你主动现身，那更好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别装傻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们爬错山了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在山顶，在这片云海山峦中最高峰的山顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们爬到那座山峰上了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......忘水坪什么都没有，与寻常山道无异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！别动那只杯子——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"哦......这不是年吗？\n好久不见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻此地，才是尚蜀山峦之中的最高处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般谈论“最高处”的时候，是不用带上此时此刻的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"良辰美景方为山顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是物理意义上的最高有什么意义，我在这儿垫一个椅子，不就更高一截了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个地方......我确实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在梦里见过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年小姐果然知道些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然了。你和这玩意在一起的时间太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然寻常人类发现不了这只酒盏的秘密，但是司岁台也好你也好都太不注意了点哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是说，这也是你的考量......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我的事情先不提......那边那位少年似乎想要积极发言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......首先，我要求你们为夕的离开做出解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛丝小姐仍旧把你当作罗德岛的一员，如此说来，在场三人，全部都与那罗德岛有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据你们的回答和今次事件的结果......我会考虑上书朝廷，严肃对待此事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把夕带走只是我的判断，罗德岛也不过是接受了我的私人委托而已，这样的答案满意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不满意。你们十二人任何一次会晤、通信、交谈都是牵扯司岁台神经的大事，你怎会不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，年纪轻轻，口气倒是挺老成......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台现在的老大是谁？我认得不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你游手好闲太久，人间已变了几个模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕在哪里？令又在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们三人相聚尚蜀，又打算做什么？这只酒盏......又隐藏了什么秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒盏明明是你们托人从龙门送来的，怎么还怪起我们来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道司岁台必须把它握在手里的意义——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——当然，这其中可是拘押着我那好二哥的部分意识的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很清楚。那就很难说几位都是不知者无罪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没打算装什么不知者......虽然梁洵确实什么都没告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，事到如今我说罗德岛什么都不知道会不会有点牵强？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，毕竟你是受害者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是刚刚才意识到的。反倒是你们司岁台啊，一群闲着没事的琢磨了这么多年，还琢磨不出吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨兽不仅能将自己分离成拥有独立人格的代理人，也能将自己的意识存储在一些媒介中苟且偷生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是你们代理人原来还能再做一次同样的事情吗？就像乌萨斯套娃一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道我们能不能啊......说不定是他新琢磨出来的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了凑齐一百八十一颗黑子之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他不会疯掉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不是已经疯掉了吗。就关押在京城，你们又不是见不到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与他见面，是莫大的禁忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台都做了这么多事，还在乎这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕呢？你找夕做什么？找了夕还来这里，又为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有一个想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据记载，你总是有很多想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你倒是挺了解我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看向这边了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......想办法干掉那个玩意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨。\n细密的春雨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个走水路的船夫，此刻走在高高的山上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天快黑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......上山下山的，可苦了我这把老骨头......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
